|---17                                                                        |
|---34                                                                        |
|---11                                                                        |
|---11                                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|     +------------------------------------+                                  |
|     |                2        2          |                                  |
|o2 = |monomialIdeal (a , a*b, b )         |                                  |
|     +------------------------------------+                                  |
